{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Long Gone Days is a JRPG set in the real world about human connection during war, focusing on civilians, language barriers, and borders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/510540/extras/b9de46abf4f498d66ce42c11799898e6.poster.avif?t=1764629097\" width=610 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/510540/extras/b9de46abf4f498d66ce42c11799898e6.webm?t=1764629097\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/510540/extras/b9de46abf4f498d66ce42c11799898e6.mp4?t=1764629097\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow <strong>Rourke</strong>, young man trained from birth to be a sniper for <strong>The Core</strong>\u2014 a subterranean paramilitary state.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On his first mission, he is sent to the surface under orders of great significance. Motivated to finally be able to show the fruits of his training, he carries out his first orders to perfection only to find out that <strong>The Core was far from being the noble organization he thought he knew</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/510540/extras/7c69c11f04db6a59500a9c81776243eb.poster.avif?t=1764629097\" width=614 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/510540/extras/7c69c11f04db6a59500a9c81776243eb.webm?t=1764629097\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/510540/extras/7c69c11f04db6a59500a9c81776243eb.mp4?t=1764629097\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Nuanced Look at War:</strong> Experience the clash of modern conflict against civilian life through the contrast of intense RPG combat and slower, slice-of-life gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Communication is Key:</strong> As Long Gone Days is set in the real world, you'll encounter several language barriers. Recruit interpreters in order to communicate with others and forge bonds beyond borders.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strength in Others:</strong> Meet a colorful cast of potential comrades. Grow relationships through your words and actions as you live and fight together. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Keep Morale High:</strong> Choose dialogue options wisely to boost morale in battle. Every character has distinct personality traits and motivations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic RPG Combat:</strong>  Spot and take down targets from afar in Sniper Mode, or engage up-close in front-view, turn-based combat. Target specific parts of an enemy\u2019s body for a tactical advantage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No Random Encounters:</strong> Every battle is hand-crafted and directly related to the plot. Your choices in battle will shape your party's lives, and the world around them. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/510540/extras/77ab00dfd3d8c79523cf745d42e78daa.poster.avif?t=1764629097\" width=598 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/510540/extras/77ab00dfd3d8c79523cf745d42e78daa.webm?t=1764629097\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/510540/extras/77ab00dfd3d8c79523cf745d42e78daa.mp4?t=1764629097\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Inner Core","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/510540/6b2ecde6149b77aa42ae992bc5146a8ddf5b169d.jpg"},{"name":"Tech Support","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/510540/d2be4b31dadeea7b13888650b6898d51b58ab91a.jpg"},{"name":"Hello World","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/510540/1cbbc522794bde8f348d4d915f29487211f3e3a0.jpg"},{"name":"First Aid Delivery","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/510540/7f02b780175a3e2fc4920fc867e69bd13ebc97da.jpg"},{"name":"Can't Hear You!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/510540/88d915b8bf86b95eaa03173f40c79d3918be40f8.jpg"},{"name":"Lost Raven","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/510540/a7380f1a3d3f530d07da1bebb1bdae0658e87fa9.jpg"},{"name":"Good Samaritans","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/510540/86523345c6ef4e3c741e7a84fa40aa90c935033c.jpg"},{"name":"Hidden in Plain Sight","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/510540/1734b730067d13ad156968159bd53ad15309898a.jpg"},{"name":"Quotidian Angel","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/510540/ed351c6e3e1a4e492784212f9bca9d844e0abe87.jpg"},{"name":"Victimless Crime","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/510540/55bb63404a8e613172e8ab2d87c4ccadfa860065.jpg"}],"total":44},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/510540?t=1764629097","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/510540/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1764629097","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com